{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-19393-r4518489","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Potato and Cabbage Soup","sourcePageId":19393,"sourceRevision":"4518489","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-21T16:27:52Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Potato%20and%20Cabbage%20Soup&oldid=4518489","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:20:28.261Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Albanian recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for soup","Category:Recipes using beet","Category:Recipes using broth and stock","Category:Recipes using cabbage","Category:Recipes using carrot","Category:Recipes using celery","Category:Recipes using cream","Category:Recipes using margarine","Category:Recipes using pepper","Category:Recipes using potato","Category:Recipes using salt","Category:Recipes using wheat flour","Category:Recipes without cooking time"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"55e7182be98604711dee8badda3e3fdadaff68854128596ee5fb4fb33ef13366","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Soup recipes\n| Servings = 4\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\n'''Potato and cabbage soup''' (Albanian: '''supë borsh me patate e lakër''') is an [[Cookbook:Cuisine of Albania|Albania]]n [[Cookbook:Soup|soup]].\n\n==Ingredients==\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]], [[Cookbook:Grating|grated]]\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoons]] [[Cookbook:Oil and Fat|oil]] or [[Cookbook:Margarine|margarine]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Carrot|carrot]]s, finely [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]]\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Celery|celery]] stalks, finely chopped\n* 1 tablespoon [[Cookbook:Flour|flour]]\n* 1 tablespoon [[Cookbook:Tomato|tomato]] sauce\n* 5 [[Cookbook:Cup|cups]] meat [[Cookbook:Stock|stock]]\n* 1 pound [[Cookbook:Cabbage|cabbage]], finely chopped\n* 2 tablespoons [[Cookbook:Vinegar|vinegar]]\n* 1 pound [[Cookbook:Potato|potato]]es, [[Cookbook:Dice|diced]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Beet|beet]] roots, diced\n* [[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]]\n* [[Cookbook:Pepper|Pepper]]\n* 4 tablespoons [[Cookbook:Cream|cream]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n# [[Cookbook:saute|Sauté]] onion lightly in oil. \n# Add carrots and celery and continue to sauté. \n# Add flour and continue to sauté. \n# Add tomato sauce and a few tablespoons of stock slowly, stirring continuously. Cook over low heat until the sauce is ready. \n# [[Cookbook:Boiling|Boil]] the remaining stock and add cabbage. \n# Add vinegar and cook for 15 minutes, then add potatoes and beet roots and cook for another 5 minutes. \n# Season with salt and pepper and serve hot, covered with a tablespoon of cream for each dish.\n\n==References==\n''This article contains information from [http://www.frosina.org Frosina.org] and it is used with [[Wikipedia:User:Dori/www.frosina.org permission|permission]].''\n\n[[Category:Albanian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for soup]]\n[[Category:Recipes using potato]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cabbage]]\n[[Category:Recipes using beet]]\n[[Category:Recipes using carrot]]\n[[Category:Recipes using celery]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cream]]\n[[Category:Recipes using salt]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pepper]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using broth and stock]]\n[[Category:Recipes using margarine]]","isR